    "description": "<p>The affected creature suffers a –2 morale penalty on attack rolls, weapon damage rolls, and saving throws. It flees from the caster as well as it can. If unable to flee, the creature may fight. Creatures with 6 or more Hit Dice are immune. Cause fear counters remove fear.</p><p><strong>Note</strong>: Mind-affecting spells do not affect nonintelligent creatures, and fear spells do not affect undead.</p>",
